+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+ 9,21
|        Help                                                                    |
|                                                                                |
|Topics are:                                                                     |
|                                                                                |
|    0 - Exit help     1 - Symbols                                               |
|    2 - Moving        3 - Commands                                              |
|    4 - Attack        5 - Spells                                                |
|    6 - Fire          7 - Seige                                                 |
|                                                                                |
|Topic number please:                                                            |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+ 18,29
|        Commands:                                                               |
|                                                                                |
|The escape key will exit quest.                                                 |
|The erase page key will refresh the screen.                                     |
| A     -  attack any being.                                                     |
| R     -  release an object.                                                    |
| T     -  take an object from your castle.                                      |
| M     -  move automatic".                                                      |
| D     -  display spells status.                                                |
| G     -  allow use of a spyglass                                               |
| L     -  list all players or castle status.                                    |
| C     -  cast non-attack spell.                                                |
| Q     -  quit seiging any castle.                                              |
| X     -  allow castle rename within a castle.                                  |
| K     -  allow killing off of player.                                          |
| F     -  fire bow or cross bow.                                                |
| ?     -  examine territory maps                                                |
|                                                                                |
|Hit any character to continue                                                   |
